'''''Lemanea fluviatilis''''' is a species of [[alga]] belonging to the family [[Lemaneaceae]].<ref name="Algaebase">{{cite web |title=Lemanea fluviatilis (Linnaeus) C.Agardh 1811 :: Algaebase |url=https://www.algaebase.org/search/species/detail/?species_id=32651 |website=www.algaebase.org |access-date=5 February 2021}}</ref>

It is native to Europe and Northern America.<ref name="GBIF">{{cite web |title=Lemanea fluviatilis (Linnaeus) C.Agardh |url=https://www.gbif.org/species/5275855 |website=www.gbif.org |access-date=5 February 2021 |language=en}}</ref>

